{
  "schema": "lgpe-gamedata-v1",
  "format": "LGPE-message",
  "lines": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "id": "msg_main0110_doctor_01",
      "hash": "484df45b107f77ec",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "大木博士：喔～！[VAR TRNAME(0000)]！\\n[VAR POKNAME(0002)]的状态还好吗？"
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "id": "msg_main0110_doctor_14",
      "hash": "484a735b107c66e2",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "……嗯？嗯嗯！？"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "id": "msg_main0110_doctor_02",
      "hash": "484df75b107f7d05",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "大木博士：嚯～！\\n看来[VAR POKNAME(0002)]已经完全\\r\\n成为[VAR TRNAME(0000)]你的搭档了！\\c\\n你很有训练家的才能啊！"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "id": "msg_main0110_doctor_03",
      "hash": "484df65b107f7b52",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "……什么？\\n你有东西要给我？"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "id": "msg_main0110_sys_01",
      "hash": "4167fe4e820569e0",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR TRNAME(0000)]把包裹\\n交给了大木博士！"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "id": "msg_main0110_doctor_04",
      "hash": "484df15b107f72d3",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "大木博士：喔！已经到了是吗！\\n这是我订购的东西！\\r\\n真是谢谢你了！"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "id": "msg_rival_01_p12_t001_r0301",
      "hash": "83d2cff374bc37f6",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 6]"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "id": "msg_rival_01_p13_t001_r0301",
      "hash": "aaddc4c56bc5382b",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 7]"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "id": "msg_main0110_rival_01",
      "hash": "0af935fdb5aacddf",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR TRNAME(0001)]：大木博士～～！\\n就教我的[VAR POKNAME(0004)]招式……"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "id": "msg_main0110_rival_02",
      "hash": "0af936fdb5aacf92",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR TRNAME(0001)]：哇！\\n[VAR TRNAME(0000)]！那是什么！好厉害啊！\\r\\n[VAR POKNAME(0002)]居然趴在你身上呢！"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "id": "msg_main0110_doctor_05",
      "hash": "484df05b107f7120",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "大木博士：是[VAR TRNAME(0001)]吗！\\n你来的正好！\\c\\n我收到个好东西，\\n就送给你们俩吧！"
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "id": "msg_main0110_sys_02",
      "hash": "4168014e82056ef9",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR TRNAME(0000)]从大木博士那里\\n得到了[VAR COLOR(0006)]蔓莓果[VAR COLOR(0000)]！"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "id": "msg_main0110_rival_03",
      "hash": "0af937fdb5aad145",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR TRNAME(0001)]：看上去很好吃啊！"
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "id": "msg_main0110_doctor_06",
      "hash": "484df35b107f7639",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "大木博士：真是拿你没办法！\\n那是给宝可梦吃的东西！\\c\\n捕捉宝可梦时……\\c\\n在准备精灵球之前\\n投出蔓莓果的话，\\r\\n宝可梦就会变得高兴，\\r\\n这样也就更容易捉到了唷！"
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "id": "msg_main0110_rival_04",
      "hash": "0af930fdb5aac560",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR TRNAME(0001)]：好险啊……\\n差点就被我给吃了。"
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "id": "msg_main0110_doctor_07",
      "hash": "484df25b107f7486",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "大木博士：你们两个都听好了！\\n无论是提高宝可梦的收集数量，\\r\\n还是培育自己中意的宝可梦，\\r\\n这都是你们的自由！\\c\\n重要的是要乐在其中喔！"
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "id": "msg_main0110_rival_05",
      "hash": "0af931fdb5aac713",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR TRNAME(0001)]：我要捉\\n好多好多的宝可梦！\\c\\n不仅如此，\\n我还想把它们训练得更强！"
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "id": "msg_main0110_doctor_08",
      "hash": "484dfd5b107f8737",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "大木博士：希望你能与\\n更多的宝可梦相遇！"
    }
  ],
  "unpaired_labels": [
    {
      "id": "msg_main_event_0110_max",
      "hash": "5c8d354eeb052d05"
    }
  ]
}
